<!-- 三态：加载失败重试 / 首次加载骨架 / 正常内容；条件链内不插入注释 -->
<view class="page state-page" wx:if="{{loadError}}">
    <view class="state-card">
        <text class="state-icon">◇</text>
        <text class="state-title">宝物没能加载出来</text>
        <text class="state-desc">{{loadError}}</text>
        <text class="state-hint">这通常是网络或云端服务暂时不稳定，宝物本身还在，稍后重试即可。</text>
        <button class="btn-primary state-btn" bindtap="retryLoad">重新加载</button>
        <button class="btn-ghost state-btn" bindtap="goBackMap">返回寻宝地图</button>
    </view>
</view>
<view class="page state-page" wx:elif="{{!treasure}}">
    <view class="state-card">
        <text class="state-icon">◇</text>
        <text class="state-title">正在打开宝物…</text>
        <text class="state-desc">正在读取谜题与寻宝提示</text>
    </view>
</view>
<view class="page" wx:else>
    <view class="main-card">
        <!-- 顶部：宝物身份 + 收藏 -->
        <view class="mc-head">
            <view class="head-row">
                <view class="head-main">
                    <text class="t-name">{{treasure.name}}</text>
                    <text class="t-meta">埋于 {{treasure.buriedAtText}}</text>
                </view>
                <view class="fav-btn {{favorited ? 'fav-on' : ''}}" bindtap="toggleFavorite">
                    <text class="fav-icon">{{favorited ? '★' : '☆'}}</text>
                    <text class="fav-text">{{favorited ? '已收藏' : '收藏'}}</text>
                </view>
            </view>
            <view class="riddle-box">
                <text class="riddle-label">谜题</text>
                <text class="riddle-text">{{treasure.riddle}}</text>
            </view>
            <block wx:if="{{treasure.photoPath}}">
                <image wx:if="{{photoUrl}}" class="t-photo" src="{{photoUrl}}" mode="aspectFill" bindtap="previewPhoto" />
                <view wx:elif="{{needLogin}}" class="photo-login">
                    <text class="photo-login-tip">登录后可查看藏宝现场照</text>
                    <button class="btn-ghost" size="mini" bindtap="onLoginTap">微信一键登录</button>
                </view>
            </block>
        </view>

        <!-- 距离状态条：一行紧凑展示 -->
        <view class="mc-dist">
            <view class="dist-left">
                <block wx:if="{{positionReady}}">
                    <text class="dist-tip">{{inRange ? '已进入核销范围 · ' : '距你 '}}</text>
                    <text class="dist-value {{inRange ? 'dist-ok' : ''}}">{{distText}}</text>
                </block>
                <block wx:else>
                    <text class="dist-tip">还没拿到你的位置</text>
                </block>
            </view>
            <view class="dist-right">
                <view class="dist-locate" bindtap="reLocate">重新定位</view>
            </view>
        </view>

        <!-- 主操作：导航 + 带走 并排 -->
        <view class="mc-actions-wrap">
            <view class="mc-actions">
                <button class="btn-ghost mc-btn" bindtap="goNavigate">
                    <text class="mc-btn-icon">➤</text>
                    <text>导航到这里</text>
                </button>
                <button class="btn-primary mc-btn" disabled="{{!inRange || taking}}" bindtap="takeTreasure">
                    我已带走
                </button>
            </view>
            <text class="mc-note">{{inRange ? '已进入核销范围，可以带走或留提示' : '走到 30 米内解锁「带走 / 追加提示」'}}</text>
        </view>

        <!-- 追加提示：默认折叠，点开才展开输入框 -->
        <view class="mc-hint">
            <view class="mc-hint-head" bindtap="toggleHintBox">
                <text class="mc-hint-title">不想带走？留一条提示，让它继续埋着</text>
                <text class="mc-hint-arrow">{{hintBoxOpen ? '收起 −' : '展开 +'}}</text>
            </view>
            <block wx:if="{{hintBoxOpen}}">
                <textarea
                    class="hint-input"
                    placeholder="写一句线索，帮下一个人找到它"
                    value="{{hintInput}}"
                    bindinput="onHintInput"
                    maxlength="100" />
                <button class="btn-ghost mc-hint-submit" disabled="{{!inRange || hintSending}}" bindtap="submitHint">
                    继续埋藏 · 追加提示
                </button>
            </block>
        </view>

        <!-- 分享 -->
        <view class="mc-share">
            <button class="btn-ghost mc-share-btn" open-type="share">喊朋友一起来找</button>
        </view>

        <!-- 提示列表 -->
        <view class="mc-hints" wx:if="{{treasure.hints.length > 0}}">
            <text class="panel-label">寻宝人留下的提示（{{treasure.hints.length}}）</text>
            <view class="hint-row" wx:for="{{treasure.hints}}" wx:key="id">
                <image wx:if="{{item.authorAvatar}}" class="hint-avatar" src="{{item.authorAvatar}}" mode="aspectFill" />
                <view wx:else class="hint-avatar hint-avatar-text">{{item.authorInitial}}</view>
                <view class="hint-body">
                    <view class="hint-head">
                        <text class="hint-author">{{item.authorName}}</text>
                        <text class="hint-time">{{item.timeText}}</text>
                    </view>
                    <text class="hint-text">{{item.text}}</text>
                </view>
            </view>
        </view>
    </view>
</view>

<privacy-modal />
